# Used by BuildKit for realtime/Dockerfile only (context = repo root). An
# allow-list: the context would otherwise include node_modules, .data and the
# repo .env with every secret in it.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!shared/package.json
!shared/src/**
!realtime/package.json
!realtime/src/**
!app/package.json
